     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Issuing a \"GET\" iTQL query to fedora/risearch, constraining the object on a string literal that is a multibyte utf-8 string returns incorrect results.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce, create an object with the following relationship in RELS-EXT:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "(the byte sequence for the literal below is 0xE2, 0x80, 0x9C, 0xCE, 0x910x20, 0xC2, 0xBF, 0xE2, 0x80, 0x9D",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "which is: left double quotes; capital alpha; space; inverted question mark; right double quotes)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<info:fedora/some:pid> <urn:bar> '\"Α ¿\"'",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The sample iTQL query for this is:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "select $s from <#ri> where $s <urn:bar> '\"Α ¿\"'",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Issuing this in the fedora/risearch web interface (ie via POST) works fine - the tuple is returned.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The GET version of this is as follows (url-encoded)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/risearch?query=select+%24s+from+%3C%23ri%3E+where+%24s+%3Curn%3Abar%3E+%27%E2%80%9C%CE%91+%C2%BF%E2%80%9D%27&type=tuples&lang=itql&flush=true&format=Sparql"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fedora/risearch?query=select+%24s+from+%3C%23ri%3E+where+%24s+%3Curn%3Abar%3E+%27%E2%80%9C%CE%91+%C2%BF%E2%80%9D%27&type=tuples&lang=itql&flush=true&format=Sparql",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This returns no results.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This currently impacts integration tests for example fedora.test.api.TestRelationships.testAddRelationship() when tests are added for multibyte utf-8 literals.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Windows XP client and server (same machine), Server platform encoding set to utf-8 (also occurs when set to cp1252",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
