 "id": "10519",
 "key": "FCREPO-569",
 "renderedFields": {
  "aggregateprogress": null,
  "aggregatetimeestimate": null,
  "aggregatetimeoriginalestimate": null,
  "aggregatetimespent": null,
  "assignee": null,
  "attachment": [],
  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Reproduced using a simpler test case using the copyright symbol: ©<br/>\nIncluding &lt;dc:rights&gt;©&lt;/dc:rights&gt; in the DC datastream results in the correct triple in the resource index.</p>\n\n<p>URL-encoding this character (for HTTP GET RI query) gives %c2%a9</p>\n\n<p>Using this in the query returns no results.</p>\n\n<p>However using just the ASCII equivalent, ie %a9 does return results.</p>\n\n<p>So it would appear that where the query parameter is being url-decoded, this is not done wrt utf-8 correctly.</p>",
     "created": "02/Nov/09 7:13 AM",
     "id": "11048",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10519/comment/11048",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "02/Nov/09 7:13 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a13283b8c6006bf8c461",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13283b8c6006bf8c461",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I can reproduce this on OSX. <br/>\nI believe the UTF based URIs are not properly decoded by Tomcat with the current default configuration. The Tomcat Configuration Reference<span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> states:  \"This <span class=\"error\">&#91;URIEncoding&#93;</span> specifies the character encoding used to decode the URI bytes, after %xx decoding the URL. If not specified, ISO-8859-1 will be used.\" The property is not set, so it defaults to ISO-8859-1. After setting this property in server.xml the query seems to be encoded correctly. </p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> <a href=\"http://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-5.5-doc/config/http.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-5.5-doc/config/http.html</a></p>",
     "created": "02/Nov/09 10:47 AM",
     "id": "11049",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10519/comment/11049",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a13283b8c6006bf8c461",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13283b8c6006bf8c461",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "02/Nov/09 10:47 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I can confirm Kai's solution - that adding URIEncoding=\"UTF-8\" to the connector in server.xml resolves this on Windows.</p>\n\n<p>Suggest we<br/>\n(1) document this; and<br/>\n(2) modify fedora.utilities.install.container.TomcatServerXML to add this attribute<br/>\nor<br/>\n(1) standardise on ISO-8859-1 url-encoding throughout Fedora; however this may cause more issues as UTF-8 encoding is pretty much standardised on outside of URLs</p>\n\n<p>W3C recommendation is to use UTF-8:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/html40/appendix/notes.html#non-ascii-chars\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/html40/appendix/notes.html#non-ascii-chars</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/api/java/net/URLEncoder.html#encode%28java.lang.String,%20java.lang.String%29\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://java.sun.com/j2se/1.5.0/docs/api/java/net/URLEncoder.html#encode%28java.lang.String,%20java.lang.String%29</a></p>",
     "created": "02/Nov/09 11:51 AM",
     "id": "11050",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10519/comment/11050",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "03/Nov/09 6:00 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Sounds like UTF-8 is the right option, I agree with your first solution (document it and modify TomcatServerXML to add the attribute).  Too bad Tomcat doesn't default to that, though.  I wonder what other appservers do.</p>\n\n<p>Note: The document to update is <a href=\"http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Installation+and+Configuration+Guide\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Installation+and+Configuration+Guide</a></p>",
     "created": "03/Nov/09 11:58 AM",
     "id": "11054",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10519/comment/11054",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
